Third-party material
--------------------

1. Base notebook
   nb/biohub-0-953-lb-original/ is an unmodified copy of the public Kaggle notebook
   "Biohub 0.953 LB | ORIGINAL" by anvithpothula
   (https://www.kaggle.com/code/anvithpothula/biohub-0-953-lb-original),
   released on Kaggle under the Apache 2.0 open source license.
   It builds on public work and weights by Pilkwang Kim (https://www.kaggle.com/pilkwang).

2. Modified files
   notebooks/*/notebook.ipynb are modified versions of that notebook. The modifications are:
   - configuration overrides appended to the first code cell;
   - the configuration-drift guard in the second code cell changed from an error to a message;
   - additional code cells inserted (sub/cells_final/): a learned division model and, for
     best_private_readd_mix, a cell-state-aware ILP;
   - for best_private_readd_mix, a post-processing patch (sub/replaces/csilp_pp.py).
   sub/build_notebooks.py rebuilds them from the unmodified copy.

3. Public weights (not included)
   The base pipeline's detection and edge-scoring weights are downloaded from the Kaggle datasets
   pilkwang/biohub-deepcenter-unet3d-center-prior-v1, pilkwang/biohub-temporal-unet3d-seed314159-v1,
   pilkwang/biohub-tracking-support-pack-50ep-v1 and anvithpothula/biohub-v1284-head-s075
   by repro/01_download.sh, under the terms of those datasets.

4. Metric (not included)
   pipe/score_csv.py uses the official metric of the organizers' repository
   https://github.com/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition (BSD-3-Clause),
   cloned by repro/00_setup.sh.

5. Competition data (not included)
   The weights in weights/ were trained on the data of the Kaggle competition
   "Biohub – Cell Tracking During Development", which is released under CC0: Public Domain.
   The data is not redistributed here; download it from the competition page.
